}

SystemException <|-- UserException
SystemException <|-- EnrolmentException
SystemException <|-- AttendanceException
SystemException <|-- PersistenceException
UserException <|-- UserNotFoundException
UserException <|-- InvalidCredentialsException
EnrolmentException <|-- PrerequisiteNotMetException
EnrolmentException <|-- CourseFullException
EnrolmentException <|-- ClashException
EnrolmentException <|-- AlreadyEnrolledException
AttendanceException <|-- SessionClosedException
AttendanceException <|-- NotEnrolledException
AttendanceException <|-- DuplicateAttendanceException
PersistenceException <|-- CorruptDataException
